          "text": "Lelo ilyo intungulushi sha ku Babiloni shatumine inkombe kukwisa mwipusha pa cipeshamano cacitike mu calo, Lesa amulekelefye pakuti amone no kwishiba ifintu fyonse ifyaba mu mutima wakwe.",
